# Phase 8: Project Demonstration

## Project Title

**LegalEase – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator**

## Demonstration Overview

The project demonstration presents the complete working process of the LegalEase application, from entering user information to generating, editing, and downloading an AI-assisted legal document.

## Demonstration Objectives

The demonstration shows:

- Project introduction
- Problem addressed by LegalEase
- Purpose of the application
- Technologies used
- Application interface
- User input process
- AI-powered document generation
- Generated document output
- Document editing
- TXT file download
- Final working result

## Demonstration Workflow

```text
Open LegalEase
      ↓
Select Document Type
      ↓
Enter Party Details
      ↓
Enter Terms and Conditions
      ↓
Enter Effective Date
      ↓
Click Generate Document
      ↓
FastAPI Backend
      ↓
Google Gemini
      ↓
Generate Legal Document
      ↓
Preview / Edit
      ↓
Download TXT
